<h1>Call Script at KUBE Start-Up</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>There is an extra functionality in KUBE to run a script file at the software start-up. Currently it can be enabled via the registry only.</p>
<p>Please, follow the steps to set the correct values for this option:</p>
<ol>
<li class="kadov-p-Csteps">
<p class="steps">Click on the <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>WIndows</i></span> <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Start</i></span> button and choose <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Run</i></span> program</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Csteps">
<p class="steps">Type "regedit" in the drop-down list, then confirm the dialog</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Csteps">
<p class="steps">Find in the registry:<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b><br>
HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\3DSCANNERS\KUBE_xx.x\Scrip</b></span>t<br>
, where KUBE_xx.x is the currently installed version of KUBE.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Csteps">
<p class="steps">There are 2 keys in this registry folder</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>[Startup]</b></span> - manages the script calling at KUBE start-up. Meaning of the available values for this key:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>0</b></span> - run script at start-up disabled</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>1</b></span> - run script at start-up enabled</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>[StartupFile]</b></span> - the name and the path of the script should be set as value of this key.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>If starting KUBE now the chosen script will be executed at the software start-up.</p>

